        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Alex Zhuravlev",
          "email": "azhuravlev@thelustrecollective.com",
          "date": "2026-11-26 16:13:13.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-21271 tests: replay-single/70f to enable writeback cache",
        "message": "LU-21271 tests: replay-single/70f to enable writeback cache\n\nthis is needed to workaround data mismatch problem: replay_barrier()\nturns OST read-only (which means dropping all writes), but then the\nclient reads data back.\n\nthis is a problem on ldiskfs only as ZFS doesn't drop writes, instead\nit rollbacks to per-RO state.\n\nthe workaround is to enable writeback cache on OST when ldiskfs is\nused, so reads can be served from the cache.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alex Zhuravlev <azhuravlev@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I34a643d0f862ebe10ce31271246e129b79951bda\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
